  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-081 (Phase 4 — app: first usable build): Accounts and login screen: add, select and remove an account, login through `HFRClient`, credentials in the account store, session restored at launch, typed errors shown.\n\n### Scope\n\nAccounts and login screen: add, select and remove an account, login through `HFRClient`, credentials in the account store, session restored at launch, typed errors shown\n\n- Module: App · Difficulty: medium · Priority: high\n- Audit source: E-6, NET-04\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-080 (#98), LOT-043 (#69), LOT-065 (#90)\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-081-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#33](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/33) — LOT-081: accounts and login screen (open; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#31](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/31) — chore(lots): claim LOT-081 and LOT-082 (#100) (app, Mac) (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#51](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/51) — Claim wave 4 (021, 022, 030, 033) and add app lots 080-083 (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#95](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/95) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n`mac/w2-081-opus` since 2026-10-27\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `in-progress`.\n",
